About the data
--------------

The recipe data in this addon is not ours. It is extracted from World of Warcraft's own game files (read through
wago.tools) and only repackaged here, by ID, so Azeroth Mercantile Exchange can use it. World of Warcraft and its
game data are the property of Blizzard Entertainment, Inc.; we claim no ownership of them.

The MIT licence below covers only what we made: the way the data is selected, arranged and packaged (the file format
and this addon). It grants no rights in Blizzard's game data.


